      "type": "QuestionClass",
      "questionClass": "Relative system cost between two capacity portfolios",
      "robustness": "robust",
      "robustnessBasis": "Agreement study, OpenGrid 2026: the sign of the cost difference between portfolio pairs survived transfer to the synthetic network in 41 of 44 paired cases. The three that did not were all within 0.4% on the real network."
